{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/558125-one-thing-that-rings-in-my-head-about-beast","id":558125,"title":"One thing that rings in my head about Beast.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-17T05:52:01-07:00","id":558125,"title":"One thing that rings in my head about Beast.","content":"Is anyone else getting a Freddy Kruger vibe from all of this? The Lairs...the Dream stuff...the victims...the Heroes spawned from their depradations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T10:30:27-07:00","id":558402,"title":"","content":"Doesn't strike me as primal enough...Unless you dial it up to New Nightmare levels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The phrase 'flies on the heads of pins' appeared 43 times in that journal, sometimes in the middle of sentences or written in the margins.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4871-malkydel","name":"Malkydel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4871_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T10:56:22-07:00","id":558433,"title":"","content":"Plus he's obviously a Slasher.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T11:19:42-07:00","id":558476,"title":"","content":"@Malkydel Maybe I am seeing the forest for the trees but stripping things down to the basics and not the setting, then I can totally see Freddy having the same capabilities as a Beast. I am just reading through the book when I can while at work (I know...bad employee but good gamer) and everything I read makes me go &quot;ZOMG! I can make Momma Krueger's little baby boy!&quot;<br /> <br /> @Elfive Slashers WISH they could be like Freddy. lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T13:07:28-07:00","id":558612,"title":"","content":"Beasts remind me of little Freddys more than anything else. Atavisms feel like that spooky phantom damage he does when he's killing folks in dreams. He's all-powerful inside of his boiler room, which is a Lair if I've ever seen one. He can be yanked outside of it by the &quot;heroes&quot; in many movies, where he has arbitrary weaknesses imposed upon him. He's a terrible, unrepentant monster, and we still love him and heap contempt on the idiot teenagers he victimizes to feed his deviant appetites, because he is always and forever the real star of the story. He could have been a Beast in life, and became Unfettered in death(where we are most familiar with him), if you want to make it fit <i>perfectly</i>, instead of just mostly perfectly.<br /> <br /> I am half-remembering a scene where he reveals that he was offered his power at the event of his burning death by the Dream Guides, or something. I don't recall which film that was, or if I'm remembering it accurately, but if I am... then that means that Freddy ALSO underwent something that seems a lot like the Devouring.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Also, hanging out with Jason proves he's not afraid of a little crossover. Beast all the way, and I loves it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><br /> I draw things! Wanna check it out? Click on the link below!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/jordantroy\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/jordantroy</a><br /> <br /> <i><b>YES! I do commissions! </b></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/848-jtroy","name":"JTroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar848_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T14:38:03-07:00","id":558763,"title":"","content":"Yes and I've brought it up when trying to discuss how things might work to increase the horror factor. He is a pretty decent analog to just how monstrous Beast can get. I think it is all coincidence though. Good source material for Beast Antagonists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T15:17:20-07:00","id":558793,"title":"","content":"I have to agree, with a caveat. Freddy Krueger is probably an Unfettered Beast.<br /> <br /> He caused fear among the parents of Springwood as the Springwood Slasher, likely as someone who likely a ripper on the edge of becoming a scourge before they became a Beast. However, the parents killed him, and you could probably pick out the ringleader, probably the overbearing father of Nancy Thompson as a Hero. However, since he was killed, he became an Unfettered, an ephemeral dream entity that continued its fear-spreading efforts, mostly untouchable in the physical plane.<br /> <br /> In a similar vein, a famous relatively-low Satiety figure might be the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tales_from_the_Crypt_(TV_series)\" target=\"_blank\">Cryptkeeper</a>, whose stories contain a lesson and scare others, but don't necessarily involve him hurting others, except when he does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 06-17-2015, 06:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T18:07:37-07:00","id":558904,"title":"","content":"YESSSS Cryptkeeper would be an amazing Namtaru. Creepy, revolting, but really only wants to have a good time and tell some sweet stories(that leave the listeners deeply traumatized). Would all of his Nightmares be punny names, or just most?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><br /> I draw things! Wanna check it out? Click on the link below!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/jordantroy\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/jordantroy</a><br /> <br /> <i><b>YES! I do commissions! </b></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachm